      <activity id="17a6fa7c-d3cd-52fd-bf48-dc72df315fd6" activityNameId="af91394a-9664-50eb-a3ee-3b2002ae16f1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop, with LCD monitor, office use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop, with LCD monitor, office use
The computer desktop office use is calculated according to the share between active (5.5 hrs/day), standby (2 hrs/day) and off (16.5 hrs/day) modes taken from literature information. This dataset describes the application of a LCD monitor.;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: 11aeb14c-5e10-3a9a-a358-e05ba6d3707f
Describes the use of a desktop computer with a LCD monitor. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use in an office. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from literature.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_11aeb14c-5e10-3a9a-a358-e05ba6d3707f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
